          <section class="section hero"
    style="background-image: url('/fileadmin/_processed_/8/9/csm_7A1566A2-31EC-4547-A77E-52CF4BF24CFE_691cf71a1d.webp'); background-position: right;">
    <div>
	
            <h1 class="text-white" style="max-width:780px;">Welcome to SILVA</h1>
            <h2 class="text-white" style="max-width:780px;">A comprehensive online resource for quality checked and aligned ribosomal RNA sequence data.</h2>
        
    </div>
</section>

<div id="c4460" class="hero-box ">
    <div class="row">        
        
            <div class="col-12 col-sm-6">
                
    

            <div id="c4449" class="frame frame-default frame-type-text frame-layout-0">
                
                
                    



                
                
                    

    



                
                

  <div class="text-frame"><p>SILVA provides comprehensive, quality checked and regularly updated datasets of aligned <strong>small (16S/18S, SSU)</strong> and <strong>large subunit (23S/28S, LSU)</strong> ribosomal RNA (rRNA) sequences for <strong>all three domains of life</strong> (Bacteria, Archaea and Eukarya).</p>
<p>For background information <a href="/documentation" class="link link-internal">click here</a>.</p></div>


                
                    



                
                
                    



                
            </div>

        


            </div>
            
        
            <div class="col-12 col-sm-6">
                
    

            <div id="c4450" class="frame frame-default frame-type-textpic frame-layout-0">
                
                
                    



                
                

    
        

    



    


                

    <div class="ce-textpic ce-center ce-below">
        

        
                <div class="ce-bodytext">
                    
                    <p>SILVA is a <a href="https://globalbiodata.org/what-we-do/global-core-biodata-resources/list-of-current-global-core-biodata-resources/" target="_blank" class="link link-external" rel="noreferrer">Global Core Biodata Resource</a> and <a href="https://elixir-europe.org/platforms/data/core-data-resources" target="_blank" class="link link-external" rel="noreferrer">ELIXIR Core Data Resource</a>.</p>
                </div>
            

        
            

    <div class="ce-gallery" data-ce-columns="2" data-ce-images="2">
        
            <div class="ce-outer">
                <div class="ce-inner">
        
        
            <div class="ce-row">
                
                    
