                </h3>
            </div>

            <!-- teaser -->
            <div class="teaser-text">
                
                
                    <div itemprop="description"><p>Our colleagues from LPSN ask you to participate in their <a href="https://s.surveylegend.com/s/6aa7" target="_blank" class="link link-external" rel="noreferrer">survey on high-level taxonomy</a>. It is anonymous and will only take a few minutes. Feel free to share the link with your collaborators. We would also welcome feedback from other fields, including virology, mycology, botany, and zoology.</p></div>
                
                

