                <section id="c4469" class="section neutral row">
                    <div class="container">
                        
                            
    

            <div id="c4520" class="frame frame-default frame-type-header frame-layout-0">
                
                
                    



                
                
                    

    
        <header>
            

    
            <h2 class="">
                Affiliations and collaborations
            </h2>
        



            



            



        </header>
    



                
                
                
                    



                
                
                    



                
            </div>

        


                                                                       
                                                            
                            <div class="cols">                    
    
        
        <div id="c4528" class="box content-box default">
            <h4 class="header">ARB</h4>

            <div class="content">
                
                    
                        
                                <a href="http://www.arb-home.de">
                                    <img class="box--image" src="/fileadmin/graphics_general/main/logos/arb.svg" width="100" height="100" alt="" />
                                </a>
                            
                    
                
                
                    <p class="text-justify">The software package ARB represents a graphically-oriented, fully-integrated package of cooperating software tools for handling and analysis of sequence information. We use ARB for curation and make our datasets avaliable in ARB format, among others.</p>
                
            </div>
            
                <div class="footer">
                    <a href="http://www.arb-home.de" title="Read more" class="link">
                        
                                Visit ARB
                            
                    </a>
                </div>
            
        </div>
                                
    
        
        <div id="c4531" class="box content-box default">
            <h4 class="header">DSMZ Digital Diversity</h4>

            <div class="content">
                
                    
                        
                                <a href="https://hub.dsmz.de">
                                    <img class="box--image" src="/fileadmin/graphics_general/main/logos/D3-logo.svg" width="2255" height="598" alt="" />
                                </a>
                            
                    
                
                
                    <p class="text-justify">The Leibniz Institute DSMZ establishes an integrated suite of scientific databases of fundamental relevance for the life sciences. The databases include <a href="https://www.brenda-enzymes.org/" target="_blank" class="external-link-new-window" title="Opens external link in new window" rel="noreferrer">BRENDA</a>, <strong>SILVA</strong>, <a href="https://lpsn.dsmz.de/" target="_blank" class="external-link-new-window" title="Opens external link in new window" rel="noreferrer">LPSN</a>, <a href="https://bacdive.dsmz.de/" target="_blank" class="external-link-new-window" title="Opens external link in new window" rel="noreferrer">BacDive</a> and <a href="https://tygs.dsmz.de/" target="_blank" class="external-link-new-window" title="Opens external link in new window" rel="noreferrer">TYGS</a> which are developed in a highly coordinated manner. The resulting data platform DSMZ Digital Diversity will provide an integrated resource and will allow to link and comprehensively analyse the different types of scientific data from all domains of life sciences.</p>
                
            </div>
            
                <div class="footer">
                    <a href="https://hub.dsmz.de" title="Read more" class="link">
                        
                                Visit DSMZ Digital Diversity
                            
                    </a>
                </div>
            
        </div>
                                
    
        
        <div id="c4522" class="box content-box default">
            <h4 class="header">German Network for Bioinformatics Infrastructure</h4>

            <div class="content">
                
                    
                        
                                <a href="https://www.denbi.de">
                                    <img class="box--image" src="/fileadmin/graphics_general/main/logos/deNBI_Logo_rgb.svg" width="352" height="91" alt="" />
                                </a>
                            
                    
                
                
                    <p>SILVA is part of the German Network for Bioinformatics Infrastructure de.NBI. Help us to improve SILVA and the network by rating our service in the <a href="https://www.surveymonkey.de/r/denbi-service?sc=db-node&amp;tool=silva" target="_blank" class="link link-external" rel="noreferrer">de.NBI survey</a>.</p>
                
            </div>
            
                <div class="footer">
                    <a href="https://www.denbi.de" title="Read more" class="link">
                        
                                Visit de.NBI
                            
                    </a>
                </div>
            
        </div>
                                
    
        
        <div id="c4530" class="box content-box default">
            <h4 class="header">LPSN TaxMap</h4>

            <div class="content">
                
                    
                        
                                <a href="https://taxmap.dsmz.de">
                                    <img class="box--image" src="/fileadmin/graphics_general/main/logos/lpsn_logo.svg" width="156" height="127" alt="" />
                                </a>
                            
                    
                
                
                    <p>The List of Prokaryotic names with Standing in Nomenclature (LPSN) is used during curation of the SILVA taxonomy. SILVA adopted the EukMap application as TaxMap to provide a visual version of LPSN’s taxonomic opinion based on validly published and correct names according to the rules of ICNP. It facilitates the navigation of the prokaryotic taxonomy derived from LPSN's taxonomic perspective.&nbsp;</p>
                
            </div>
            
                <div class="footer">
                    <a href="https://taxmap.dsmz.de" title="Read more" class="link">
                        
                                Visit LPSN TaxMap
                            
                    </a>
                </div>
            
        </div>
                                
    
        
        <div id="c4529" class="box content-box default">
            <h4 class="header">RNAcentral</h4>

            <div class="content">
                
                    
                        
                                <a href="https://rnacentral.org/expert-database/silva">
                                    <img class="box--image" src="/fileadmin/graphics_general/main/logos/rnacentral-expert-database.svg" width="98" height="35" alt="" />
                                </a>
                            
                    
                
                
                    <p>RNAcentral is a free, public resource that offers integrated access to a comprehensive and up-to-date set of non-coding RNA sequences provided by a collaborating group of Expert Databases representing a broad range of organisms and RNA types. SILVA is one of the Expert Databases in the consortium.</p>
                
            </div>
            
                <div class="footer">
                    <a href="https://rnacentral.org/expert-database/silva" title="Read more" class="link">
                        
                                Visit RNACentral
                            
                    </a>
                </div>
            
        </div>
                                
    
        
        <div id="c3626" class="box content-box default">
            <h4 class="header">UniEuk</h4>

            <div class="content">
                
                    
                        
                                <a href="https://unieuk.net/">
                                    <img class="box--image" src="/fileadmin/_processed_/e/4/csm_UniEuk_146f8bf200.webp" width="304" height="80" alt="" />
                                </a>
                            
                    
                
                
                    <p>The SILVA team developed the taxonomic curation platform EukMap as part of the UniEuk project, and continues to maintain it. The UniEuk taxonomy for eukaryotes, which focuses primarily on protists is used as a basis for protists in the SILVA taxonomy.</p>
                
            </div>
            
                <div class="footer">
                    <a href="https://unieuk.net/" title="Read more" class="link">
                        
                                Visit UniEuk
                            
                    </a>
                </div>
            
        </div>
                                
    
</div>                            
                                  
                    </div>
                </section>
             
    
        </div>                

  <div class="page-footer">
    <div class="footer text-center">
    <div class="w-500 mw-full mx-auto my-20">
      <h3 class="mt-0">
        Did not find what you were looking for?      </h3>

      <p>
        Search within all databases of the
        <a href="https://hub.dsmz.de/" target="_blank" class="link">
          DSMZ Digital Diversity
        </a>
      </p>

      <form id="d3search" onsubmit="d3searchFunction()">
        <div class="input-group">
          <input type="search" name="search" id="hub-search" class="form-control" placeholder="Search across all DSMZ Digital Diversity databases">
          <div class="input-group-append">
            <button class="btn"><i class="ph ph-magnifying-glass" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </form>

      <script>
        function d3searchFunction() {
          event.preventDefault();
          var val = $('#hub-search').val();
          // url encode the search term
          var search = encodeURIComponent(val);
          var action_src = "https://hub.dsmz.de/#/search/" + search;
          window.open(action_src, '_blank');

        }
      </script>
